# Base image for every FROM in infrastructure/docker/Dockerfile (CONTRACT-DECISIONS item 20): the website's and the
# AddOn's current pin, the Docker Official Image python:3.14.8-slim-trixie (CPython 3.14.8 on Debian 13), by index
# digest. The tag beside the digest is documentation; Docker resolves the digest. scripts/check-versions.sh (ci.yml)
# fails when any FROM that is not an earlier stage differs from PYTHON_IMAGE@PYTHON_IMAGE_DIGEST. Plain shell
# assignments, read by /bin/sh.
# [VERIFY] re-resolve the digest at the first image build (docker buildx imagetools inspect python:3.14.8-slim-trixie).
PYTHON_IMAGE=python:3.14.8-slim-trixie
PYTHON_IMAGE_DIGEST=sha256:a2b82f3c48559aa0a8446d9af49826b6e2b2016f4cd2afabfe6013ec53729170
PYTHON_VERSION=3.14.8
